# Diagnosis: walkto stall recovery (devscript.cpp). Run: python tools/route.py Strict tools/routes/74_walk_stall_test.dev --name <n> --seconds 120 SUNSHINE_DEV_START=dolpic/0 SUNSHINE_ALLOW_CPU_ADAPTER=0
# Mario is put east of the Delfino wall at x=4000 (normal +x, z -7900..-1000) and walks west into it: expect one `walkto stall` line (about 120 ticks after the start) and sideways movement with a jump and the walkto TIMEOUT (rc 3).
waitfor director mario dirstate=4 camDemo=0 timeout=3000
wait frames=60
tp x=4088 y=305 z=-4450
wait frames=30
walkto x=3000 z=-4450 radius=100 timeout=500
end
